    { "type": "text", "id": "iso", "x": 80, "y": 500, "width": 1200, "height": 38,
      "text": "The result is two blocks with a hole, and the model is told nothing about the hole.\nAny commitment made in msg 3 to msg 5 has simply stopped existing.",
      "originalText": "The result is two blocks with a hole, and the model is told nothing about the hole.\nAny commitment made in msg 3 to msg 5 has simply stopped existing.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 240073, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 240074, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "c1", "x": 1320, "y": 150, "width": 900, "height": 190,
      "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "#fffbeb", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 240075, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 240076, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "c1_t", "x": 1342, "y": 168, "width": 856, "height": 154,
      "text": "The head eats the budget\nThe first N are added before anything is measured against\nthe limit, and their tokens are counted toward it. A long\nsystem prompt therefore leaves less room for recent turns.\n\nAnd nothing checks that the head itself fits: if the first N\nalready exceed the limit, they are still returned and the\nrecent block ends up empty.",
      "originalText": "The head eats the budget\nThe first N are added before anything is measured against\nthe limit, and their tokens are counted toward it. A long\nsystem prompt therefore leaves less room for recent turns.\n\nAnd nothing checks that the head itself fits: if the first N\nalready exceed the limit, they are still returned and the\nrecent block ends up empty.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 240077, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 240078, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "c2", "x": 1320, "y": 370, "width": 900, "height": 170,
      "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "#fee2e2", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 240079, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 240080, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "c2_t", "x": 1342, "y": 388, "width": 856, "height": 134,
      "text": "One big message truncates everything older\nThe walk breaks on the first message that does not fit, it\ndoes not skip it and keep looking. So a single large turn in\nthe middle of the history hides every turn before it, even\nthe small ones that would have fitted comfortably.",
      "originalText": "One big message truncates everything older\nThe walk breaks on the first message that does not fit, it\ndoes not skip it and keep looking. So a single large turn in\nthe middle of the history hides every turn before it, even\nthe small ones that would have fitted comfortably.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#991b1b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 240081, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 240082, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "c3", "x": 1320, "y": 570, "width": 900, "height": 170,
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#eff6ff", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 240083, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 240084, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "c3_t", "x": 1342, "y": 588, "width": 856, "height": 134,
      "text": "Who decides, in practice\nConversationContext calls this with keepFirstN: 2, hard\ncoded. AITaskAgent:Conversation:KeepFirstNMessages is\nbound from configuration and never reaches it.\n\nWhether the window applies at all is decided per request,\nby LlmRequest.UseSlidingWindow.",
      "originalText": "Who decides, in practice\nConversationContext calls this with keepFirstN: 2, hard\ncoded. AITaskAgent:Conversation:KeepFirstNMessages is\nbound from configuration and never reaches it.\n\nWhether the window applies at all is decided per request,\nby LlmRequest.UseSlidingWindow.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 240085, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 240086, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "text", "id": "esc", "x": 80, "y": 570, "width": 1180, "height": 152,
      "text": "The escape hatch\n\nBookmarks are the answer when the hole matters. RestoreBookmark rewinds to a known\npoint deliberately, instead of letting a token budget decide what to forget. An LLM step\nalready uses one internally for exactly this reason: to control precisely what the history\nkeeps, rather than trusting a heuristic.\n\nIf the middle of a conversation carries state you cannot lose, summarise it into the head\nrather than hoping it stays inside the window.",
      "originalText": "The escape hatch\n\nBookmarks are the answer when the hole matters. RestoreBookmark rewinds to a known\npoint deliberately, instead of letting a token budget decide what to forget. An LLM step\nalready uses one internally for exactly this reason: to control precisely what the history\nkeeps, rather than trusting a heuristic.\n\nIf the middle of a conversation carries state you cannot lose, summarise it into the head\nrather than hoping it stays inside the window.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 240087, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 240088, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "text", "id": "foot", "x": 80, "y": 760, "width": 2140, "height": 19,
      "text": "Token counts are estimates, not the provider's own tokeniser. Verified against MessageHistory.GetMessagesWithSlidingWindow and ConversationContext.",
      "originalText": "Token counts are estimates, not the provider's own tokeniser. Verified against MessageHistory.GetMessagesWithSlidingWindow and ConversationContext.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 240089, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 240090, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 }

  ]
